t she's  been called up for a new job the next  morning Ethan is happy that his wife has  gained the trust of some people in the  town following this he grabs some  weapons and heads back to the forest the  episode ends as Ethan somehow scales the  Steep Hill and when he reaches the top a  mysterious humanoid-like figure lurks at  him from the Shadows to see what happens  next watch the second part in series  recapped

